sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Cluster User
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant DSPA as DSPAReconciler
    participant TLS as SecurityProfileWatcher
    participant OShift as OpenShift APIServer
    participant DB as MariaDB<br/>3306/TCP
    participant S3 as S3 / MinIO<br/>443/TCP

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over User,S3: Flow 1: DSPA Reconciliation
        User->>K8s: Create/Update DSPA CR
        K8s->>DSPA: Watch event (DSPA change)
        DSPA->>K8s: Read Secrets, ConfigMaps<br/>HTTPS/TLS 1.2+ / ServiceAccount
        K8s-->>DSPA: Secret & ConfigMap data
        DSPA->>DSPA: ExtractParams: merge CR spec,<br/>operator config, secrets into DSPAParams

        DSPA->>DB: Health check connection<br/>MySQL/3306 / TLS optional<br/>Username+Password auth
        DB-->>DSPA: Connection OK

        DSPA->>S3: Health check connection<br/>HTTPS/443 / TLS optional<br/>Access Key auth
        S3-->>DSPA: Connection OK

        DSPA->>DSPA: Render Go templates<br/>via manifestival
        DSPA->>K8s: Apply manifests<br/>(Deployments, Services, RBAC,<br/>ConfigMaps, NetworkPolicies, Routes)<br/>HTTPS/TLS 1.2+ / ServiceAccount
        K8s-->>DSPA: Resources created/updated
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 230)
        Note over TLS,OShift: Flow 2: TLS Profile Lifecycle
        TLS->>OShift: Fetch TLS profile from<br/>APIServer CR at startup<br/>HTTPS/6443 / ServiceAccount
        OShift-->>TLS: TLS profile (or fallback to Intermediate)
        TLS->>TLS: Configure webhook + metrics<br/>servers with TLS settings

        Note over TLS,OShift: Ongoing watch
        OShift->>TLS: TLS profile change detected
        TLS->>DSPA: Cancel context /<br/>graceful shutdown + restart
    end
